{"id":"portswigger-web-security-academy--server-side-vulnerabilities--path-traversal--file-path-traversal-simple-case","path":"portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/path-traversal/file-path-traversal-simple-case.md","title":"File path traversal, simple case","category":"portswigger-web-security-academy","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/path-traversal/file-path-traversal-simple-case.md","html":"<h1 id=\"file-path-traversal-simple-case\">File path traversal, simple case</h1>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This lab contains a path traversal vulnerability in the display of product images.</p>\n<p>To solve the lab, retrieve the contents of the <code>/etc/passwd</code> file.</p>\n<h2 id=\"solution\">Solution</h2>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(10)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Click to one of products shop: <a href=\"https://0ac8007304f7f39b81adf85000a300b1.web-security-academy.net/product?productId=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://0ac8007304f7f39b81adf85000a300b1.web-security-academy.net/product?productId=2</a></p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(9)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>The parameter productsID seems to not be vulnerable, than we can try to open the relative image, that usually is located into <code>/var/www/images</code> web server directory.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://0ac8007304f7f39b81adf85000a300b1.web-security-academy.net/image?filename=1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://0ac8007304f7f39b81adf85000a300b1.web-security-academy.net/image?filename=1.jpg</a></p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(11)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>In this case directory and parameter are different, capturing it with Burp and trasfer to Repeater using CTRL+R</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(7)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Here, we can modify the filename reference adding <code>../../../../../etc/passwd</code> to do five jump back into directory, arriving to root <code>/</code> and accessing to <code>/etc/passwd</code> file:</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(6)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(8)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"File path traversal, simple case screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n","toc":[{"id":"description","title":"Description","level":2},{"id":"solution","title":"Solution","level":2}],"excerpt":"File path traversal, simple case Description This lab contains a path traversal vulnerability in the display of product images. To solve the lab, retrieve the contents of the /etc/passwd file. Solution Click to one of pr","searchText":"Description Solution"}